meta {
  name: Save an answer
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attempts/{{attemptId}}/answers/{{firstQuestionId}}
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "response": "B"
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Autosave. The option key for multiple choice, prose for a written question.

  Refused after the deadline. The browser counts down too, but a client clock is a
  suggestion and this is the fact — otherwise the answer typed at 90:01 is worth the same
  as the one typed at 89:59.

  `B` may well be wrong for whichever question generation produced. That is fine and
  arguably better: it exercises the zero-mark path.
}
